# COMMANDS.log

CS 660 Project 3: Entity Authentication - Command History Log

This file records all commands and actions taken during the password hash analysis project in chronological order.

## Format
Each entry includes:
- Timestamp: ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS)
- Command: Exact command or action taken
- Purpose: Brief description of why the command was executed
- Result: Short summary of outcome

